WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.651
Whoa! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.652 --> 00:00:13.714
I'm a peregrine falcon.

3
00:00:13.715 --> 00:00:18.411
Peregrine falcons are the fastest animals on earth.

4
00:00:18.412 --> 00:00:21.082
Where do you live?

5
00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:25.734
Peregrine falcons live all over the world.

6
00:00:25.735 --> 00:00:29.187
We like being close to the sea.

7
00:00:29.188 --> 00:00:31.852
What do you eat?

8
00:00:31.853 --> 00:00:36.687
We eat other birds like ducks or pigeons.

9
00:00:36.688 --> 00:00:40.017
We also eat bats.

10
00:00:40.018 --> 00:00:43.602
How do you find prey?

11
00:00:43.603 --> 00:00:47.769
We watch from a high place.

12
00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:52.676
We wait for other birds to fly by.

13
00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:56.934
Is it hard to see from up high?

14
00:00:56.935 --> 00:01:02.571
Nope! Our eyes are amazing.

15
00:01:02.572 --> 00:01:08.306
We can spot small animals from far away.

16
00:01:08.307 --> 00:01:12.684
Is that when you fly fast?

17
00:01:12.685 --> 00:01:18.084
Yes! We dive down toward our prey.

18
00:01:18.085 --> 00:01:23.189
We catch it in midair.

19
00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:26.722
Do you have any enemies?

20
00:01:26.723 --> 00:01:31.334
Eagles and owls sometimes try to eat us.

21
00:01:31.335 --> 00:01:36.778
But we don't have many enemies.

22
00:01:36.779 --> 00:01:40.394
Oh! I see a flock of pigeons!

23
00:01:40.395 --> 00:01:43.507
Time to hunt!

24
00:01:43.508 --> 00:01:50.724
Good-bye, Peregrine Falcon!

